# Advanced Progressive NetworkPolicies & Namespace Microsegmentation

Master advanced Kubernetes NetworkPolicy patterns by enforcing strict namespace isolation and progressively whitelisting
traffic: in-cluster CoreDNS, external DNS resolvers, and L7 HTTP traffic routed through NGINX Gateway Fabric.

